# What a package build leaves behind, wherever it is run from. dpkg-buildpackage
# fills debian/pgpid/ and debian/.debhelper/ with a copy of everything it is
# about to wrap, and those are the files a careless `git add -A` sweeps in --
# which happened on 2026-09-15, forty-five of them, onto main and out to the
# remote. Ignored on every branch: on debian they are build output, and on main
# the directory only exists because a build was run there.
debian/pgpid/
debian/.debhelper/
debian/files
debian/*.substvars
debian/debhelper-build-stamp

